%% Rework sequence
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant CP as CheckpointStore
  participant S as SkillPhase
  U->>O: revise_requested
  O->>CP: restore phase boundary checkpoint
  O->>O: inject revision comments
  O->>S: rerun affected skill
  S-->>O: new artifact version
  O->>CP: save checkpoint
  O-->>U: updated progress
